# Google Drive Sync Setup

# Step 1: Go to https://console.cloud.google.com
# Step 2: Create a new project (e.g. "Check2 App")
# Step 3: Enable "Google Drive API" under APIs & Services
# Step 4: Configure OAuth Consent Screen (External, Testing mode is fine)
#         Add your own Google Account as a test user
# Step 5: Create OAuth Client ID → Type: "Web application"
#         Authorized JS origins: http://localhost:5173
#         Also add your production URL if you host it (e.g. https://yourapp.com)
# Step 6: Copy your Client ID below

